<title>JAPAN: Fujitec - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fujitec - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 24.21		vs	   21.43</p>
<p> Operating	    2.96		vs	  906    million</p>
<p> Current		4.49		vs	    2.27</p>
<p> Net		    2.02		vs	    1.33</p>
<p> EPS		   23.66 yen	  vs	   15.50 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     85 million	  vs	  85 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.50 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Fujitec Co Ltd is a manufacturer specialising in elevators.</p>
</text>
